{"id": 121, "name": "Ixia", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/2/24/Hero1211-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021140752", "cls": ["Marksman", ""], "specialty": ["Finisher", "Damage"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["30", "70", "50", "40"], "lanes": ["Gold Lane", ""], "story": "The leader of Bad Soul and self-proclaimed inventor, she wields a homemade weapon powered by a stolen Starlium reactor.", "skills": [{"name": "Siphon Starlium", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_0b28b73c43760afb3539979ea9d5c312.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 51, "tagname": "Heal", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Ixia's Basic Attacks and skills apply a stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Starlium Charge</span> to enemies on hit. When Ixia performs a Basic Attack on an enemy with two stacks of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Starlium Charge</span>, the attack consumes the stacks and is replaced by <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Siphon Starlium</span>, dealing <span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+150% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#26e407\">(+200 Lifesteal)</span> +(+10*Hero Level) <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to the target. Ixia recovers HP equal to the damage dealt (only 10<span style=\"color:#26e407\">(+150 Lifesteal)</span>% against non-hero units) and slows the target by 25% for 1s.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Siphon Starlium</span> can hit all enemies in front of Ixia within her Basic Attack range, but it cannot Crit.\nIxia's Basic Attacks cannot trigger Lifesteal."}, {"name": "Dual Beam", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_a8abf9eeb77d6cb3afccd0bd4bb9d772.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 4   Mana Cost: 35", "desc": "Ixia fires 2 Starlium-charged energy beams along the ground in the target direction, dealing 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+70% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in a rectangular area. When hitting enemy heroes, Ixia gains 50% Movement Speed for 2s.\nEnemies hit by both beams will take double damage."}, {"name": "Star Helix", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f4f780b9ada962f9e52903d9ad5359fd.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 11   Mana Cost: 65", "desc": "Ixia unleashes a canister of Starlium energy in the target direction, knocking back nearby enemies. After a short delay, it pulls enemies in range to the center line and deals 200<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+60% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>."}, {"name": "Full Barrage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_da280fb5742c603e295f58bf621d50c1.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 42   Mana Cost: 120", "desc": "Ixia reassembles her weapon into 6 smaller weapons and enters the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Full Barrage</span> state for 4s. In this state, Ixia's Basic Attacks and skills can hit enemies in the large fan-shaped area in front of her, but not outside it. Ixia's Basic Attacks can hit up to 6 enemy units (prioritizes heroes), and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Siphon Starlium</span> will fire simultaneously with her normal Basic Attacks."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Corrosion Scythe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_486be2a89fc7fba69cd82c71d80395af.png"}, {"name": "Demon Hunter Sword", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4f63658b2ae982d7684b74fca8163014.png"}, {"name": "Magic Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_80a7900e7afd6a7f63384c781b043d33.png"}, {"name": "Endless Battle", "i